WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
Andy as I seem to recall,

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:04.590
you're a pretty big trivia
guy, isn't that right?

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:06.900
I am pretty good at trivia I gotta say.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:07.960
[Conan] Oh, you think you're pretty good?

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:08.930
[Andy] I do, Yeah.

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:12.680
[Conan] Well, I too think
I'm pretty good at trivia.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:16.310
So I thought maybe we'd
have a friendly little

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:18.743
trivia competition on tonight's show.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:22.220
There's nothing friendly
about trivia Conan.

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:24.390
I know Andy.

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:27.270
I know we're both pretty
competitive about this.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:29.249
It is on, let's do it right now.

00:00:29.249 --> 00:00:32.416
(electricity buzzing)

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:37.310
Alright, here we go, you ready?

00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:40.570
[Andy] I was born ready O'Brien.

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:43.750
Alright, which planet is the fourth,

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.193
furthest from the sun?

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:46.943
Mars,

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:49.970
Correct, your turn Andy.

00:00:49.970 --> 00:00:51.580
[Andy] Alright, here we go.

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:54.670
In feudal Japan, Samurai roamed the land,

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:58.190
living by an honor code
called the Bushido.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:01.563
What is the sixth virtue of the Bushido?

00:01:02.810 --> 00:01:04.430
What, what are you talking about?

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:05.960
That's so complicated.

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:08.130
How am I supposed to know that?

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:11.350
The answer is honor Conan,
I knew you wouldn't get it.

00:01:11.350 --> 00:01:12.850
[Conan] No no no, that's not fair.

00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:14.780
Give me a simpler question.

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:19.780
[Andy] Oh, okay sure, French
philosopher Rene Descartes,

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:22.980
is well known for his work on metaphysics.

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:26.660
What object in many
displays throughout Paris.

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:30.403
First ignited Descartes'
philosophies on dualism?

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:33.310
Andy come on, it's called trivia

00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:35.690
because it's supposed to be trivial.

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:37.890
Stop giving me complicated questions.

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:40.560
Alright fine, here's a simple one.

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:43.520
What's AT&amp;T 5G ?

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:48.270
Easy, why It's 5G that's
fast, reliable and secure.

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:50.680
[Andy] That's right Conan,
t's not complicated.

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:52.850
[Conan] Alright, here's one for you, Andy.

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:56.240
Which 5G is fast, reliable and secure?

00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:58.750
[Andy] Well AT&amp;T 5G of course.

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:01.442
[Conan] That's right Andy,
it's not complicated.

00:02:01.442 --> 00:02:04.109
(both laughing)

